# leap-design-pattern — open rail hygiene (staged 2026-08-02, ships only on Operator sign)
# The PATENTS.md boundary note says "Verify .gitignore before every push" — this file makes that true.
# Nothing below should ever exist in this repo; the globs are a tripwire, not a map.
*.env
.env*
**/vaulted_keys*
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
*.pem
*.key
**/_vault/
**/financial_ledger*
.claude/
node_modules/
